    "long_instructions": "## Pet Adoption Browser\r\n\r\n**Goal:**\r\nUse a **read → transform → render** pipeline to show pets available for adoption. Add clear feedback so users know what's shown, what filters are active, and when nothing matches.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Open `script.js`.**\r\n   Find the `render()` function. This is where the pet list is built.\r\n\r\n2. **Implement the pipeline:**\r\n\r\n   * **Read:**\r\n     Use the `pets` array and apply rules (dogs or cats, age ≤ 5, good with kids).\r\n   * **Transform:**\r\n     Loop through the data and collect only pets that match the rules.\r\n   * **Render:**\r\n     Use another loop to display those results as list items on the page.\r\n\r\n3. **Add transparency cues:**\r\n\r\n   * **Count message:**\r\n     Update `#countMessage` with how many pets are shown out of the total.\r\n     Example: `Showing 2 of 5 pets`\r\n   * **Filter label:**\r\n     Describe the active rules.\r\n     Example: `Filter: dogs or cats, age ≤ 5, good with kids`\r\n   * **Empty-state message:**\r\n     If there are no matches, show a friendly empty-state message, such as `\"No pets match the current filters.\"` \r\n\r\n4. **Test your work.**\r\n\r\n5. **Use AI to check your reasoning.**",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pet Adoption Browser — Display Pipeline</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h1>Pet Adoption Browser</h1>\n      <p class=\"sub\">Browse pets that match the current filters.</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"container pills\">\n    <p id=\"countMessage\" class=\"pill\"></p>\n    <p id=\"filterLabel\" class=\"pill pill-muted\"></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <ul id=\"petList\" class=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Matching pets\"></ul>\n    <p id=\"emptyMessage\" class=\"empty\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Layout & type */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #1f2937;           /* slate-800 */\n  background: #f3f4f6;      /* gray-100 */\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n.container { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px; }\n\n/* Header */\n.header {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #eef2ff 100%);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n}\n.header h1 {\n  margin: 10px 0 6px;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n}\n.sub { margin: 0; color: #6b7280; }\n\n/* Transparency cues as pills */\n.pills { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }\n.pill {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.pill-muted { color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; }\n\n/* Grid of cards */\n.grid {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 14px 0 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 14px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  transition: transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;\n}\n.card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n}\n.card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 18px; }\n\n/* Badges row */\n.badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }\n.badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: .2px;\n  background: #eef2ff;      /* indigo-100 */\n  color: #3730a3;           /* indigo-800 */\n  border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;/* indigo-200 */\n}\n.badge.gray { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; border-color: #e5e7eb; }\n.badge.green{ background: #ecfdf5; color: #065f46; border-color: #a7f3d0; }\n\n/* Empty state */\n.empty {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-style: italic;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px dashed #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const pets = [\n  { name: \"Sunny\",  species: \"Dog\", age: 2, goodWithKids: true,  size: \"Medium\" },\n  { name: \"Marble\", species: \"Cat\", age: 7, goodWithKids: false, size: \"Small\"  },\n  { name: \"River\",  species: \"Dog\", age: 4, goodWithKids: true,  size: \"Large\"  },\n  { name: \"Peach\",  species: \"Cat\", age: 1, goodWithKids: true,  size: \"Small\"  },\n  { name: \"Bolt\",   species: \"Dog\", age: 6, goodWithKids: false, size: \"Medium\" }\n];\n\nconst render = () => {\n  const list = document.getElementById(\"petList\");\n  const countMsg = document.getElementById(\"countMessage\");\n  const label = document.getElementById(\"filterLabel\");\n  const empty = document.getElementById(\"emptyMessage\");\n  list.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n\n\n\n  \n};\n\nrender();\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
